        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DHS3035 3\" x 3-1/2\" x Square Corners Solid Brass Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSolid Brass Half Surface Hinge for Storm or Screen Doors. Door flange is surface applied to door. Jamb flange is mortised to door jamb. Used for installing new doors, including screen doors, into an existing frame.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"300\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\"\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DHS3035.jpg?v=1704354532\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSH3035 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching solid brass flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws and standard removable button tip finials. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, rust resistant, stainless steel pin.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Deltana DHS3035 Screen Door Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .135\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Half Surface</li>\r\n<li>Door flange surface applied</li>\r\n<li>Jamb flange mortise to jamb</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DHS3035.pdf?v=1704262221\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DHS3035 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the base metal will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't forget to look at <a href=\"/collections/deltana-brass-hinge-finials\">Deltana's great Finial Tips</a> to spice up your hinges!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "3 x 3-1/2 x Square Corners Solid Brass Half Surface Hinge Pair, Deltana DHS3035",
